01:48.870 --> 01:51.350
<b>I-It's not like that!
It was just an accident!</b>

01:51.350 --> 01:54.840
<b>Ridiculous. If you're going to lie,
make it more believable.</b>

01:54.880 --> 01:59.800
_

01:55.090 --> 01:59.800
Episode 6:    Thus, X Geniuses Never Learn

01:55.160 --> 01:57.290
<b><i>I can't hear them clearly.</i></b>

01:57.290 --> 01:59.620
<b><i>Something about qualified to be a tutor...</i></b>

01:59.620 --> 02:02.850
<b><i>And "illicit sexual encounters"?</i></b>

02:04.930 --> 02:07.810
<b>It was an accident!
She slipped off the cliff and...</b>

02:07.810 --> 02:09.810
<b>Coincidences like that are extremely...</b>

02:11.660 --> 02:13.820
<b>L-Long time no see, Ms. Kirisu!</b>

02:13.820 --> 02:14.780
<b>Furuhashi?</b>

02:14.780 --> 02:17.900
<b>I'm busy. If you need something, 
make it quick.</b>

02:17.900 --> 02:21.490
<b>Yuiga is always
serious about helping us!</b>

02:22.440 --> 02:25.910
<b>I-I want him to continue to be my tutor!</b>

02:26.190 --> 02:27.580
<b><i>Furuhashi.</i></b>

02:27.580 --> 02:29.900
<b>A-And the incident
at the library only happened</b>

02:29.900 --> 02:32.920
<b>because I told him to touch my stomach!</b>

02:32.920 --> 02:34.800
<b>It wasn't actually an "illicit sexual encounter"!</b>

02:34.800 --> 02:34.840
<b>{=3}SPURT</b>

02:34.800 --> 02:34.840
<b>{=2}SPURT</b>

02:34.800 --> 02:34.840
<b>{=1}SPURT</b>

02:34.840 --> 02:34.880
<b>{=3}SPURT</b>

02:34.840 --> 02:34.880
<b>{=2}SPURT</b>

02:34.840 --> 02:34.880
<b>{=1}SPURT</b>

02:34.880 --> 02:34.920
<b>{=3}SPURT</b>

02:34.880 --> 02:34.920
<b>{=2}SPURT</b>

02:34.880 --> 02:34.920
<b>{=1}SPURT</b>

02:34.920 --> 02:34.960
<b>{=3}SPURT</b>

02:34.920 --> 02:34.960
<b>{=2}SPURT</b>

02:34.920 --> 02:34.960
<b>{=1}SPURT</b>

02:34.960 --> 02:39.220
<b>{=3}SPURT</b>

02:34.960 --> 02:39.220
<b>{=2}SPURT</b>

02:34.960 --> 02:39.220
<b>{=1}SPURT</b>

02:35.140 --> 02:38.330
<b>Or the time he saw me
in my underwear when I was sick?</b>

02:38.330 --> 02:40.050
<b>That was my fault, too!</b>

02:40.050 --> 02:41.730
<b>Furuhashi, stop! Stop!</b>

02:41.730 --> 02:45.010
<b>Furuhashi, that's quite enough.
You can go now.</b>

02:48.900 --> 02:51.060
<b>U-Um... That was...</b>

02:51.560 --> 02:52.600
<b>Excuse me.</b>

02:53.180 --> 02:54.190
<b>Now Ogata?</b>

02:54.190 --> 02:55.440
<b>Ms. Kirisu.</b>

02:55.440 --> 03:00.530
<b>Certainly my grades aren't perfect,
but the issue there is effort.</b>

03:00.930 --> 03:03.240
<b>Yuiga has done nothing wrong!</b>

03:03.580 --> 03:06.170
<b>So please stop interrogating him!</b>

03:06.170 --> 03:07.040
<b><i>Ogata.</i></b>

03:07.040 --> 03:11.250
<b>Then how do you explain
the indecent incident with him?</b>

03:14.880 --> 03:18.030
<b>If it's when he was in the girls' bath,
it was a misunderstanding!</b>

03:18.030 --> 03:19.840
<b>It was my fault!</b>

03:20.720 --> 03:21.840
<b>You may leave.</b>

03:29.300 --> 03:31.000
<b>Ms. Kirisu, it's a misunderstanding!</b>

03:31.000 --> 03:35.120
<b>When he pinned me down at the pool,
we were just getting carried away.</b>

03:35.120 --> 03:36.570
<b>Well, like that!</b>

03:37.470 --> 03:39.860
<b><i>That doesn't help me at all!</i></b>

03:39.860 --> 03:41.320
<b>You may leave.</b>

03:48.630 --> 03:50.060
<b><i>It's over!</i></b>

03:50.060 --> 03:53.000
<b><i>Never mind losing my position!
I could be suspended!</i></b>

03:53.000 --> 03:54.460
<b><i>Or expelled!</i></b>

03:54.820 --> 03:55.920
<b>Yuiga.</b>

03:56.420 --> 03:59.260
<b>It seems your students are very fond of you.</b>

03:59.540 --> 04:03.280
<b>I'm sure Ogata and Furuhashi
would rather not talk to me at all,</b>

04:03.280 --> 04:05.470
<b>so for them to come here
and defend you...</b>

04:06.430 --> 04:07.720
<b>You can go.</b>

04:07.720 --> 04:09.190
<b>Good work.</b>

04:09.190 --> 04:11.100
<b>I-It's okay?</b>

04:11.100 --> 04:16.360
<b>Going by their demeanor,
the incidents really were accidents.</b>

04:16.360 --> 04:18.940
<b>Though there are several troubling points.</b>

04:20.400 --> 04:23.070
<b>I'll disregard them this time...</b>

04:23.070 --> 04:24.960
<b>But I still don't like...</b>

04:24.960 --> 04:30.740
<b>Rather, I don't approve
of you being their tutor.</b>

04:31.740 --> 04:34.750
<b>But you were their tutor too, weren't you?</b>

04:35.010 --> 04:39.860
<b>It's a crime to have an environment in which
people with talent can't make full use of it.</b>

04:39.860 --> 04:47.180
<b>If you keep indulging them in their whims,
those girls will lead unhappy lives.</b>

04:48.120 --> 04:50.390
<b>W-We can't know that unless we—</b>

04:50.390 --> 04:53.640
<b>I know it. That's how it was with me.</b>

04:55.000 --> 04:56.270
<b>No purpose.</b>

04:56.270 --> 04:58.690
<b>That's the destination
when you ditch your talent</b>

04:58.690 --> 05:02.150
<b>and choose the wrong path
based on emotions of the moment.</b>

05:02.840 --> 05:04.450
<b>I don't understand.</b>

05:05.070 --> 05:06.180
<b>Never mind.</b>

05:06.180 --> 05:09.200
<b>I have no intention of changing my ways.</b>

05:09.200 --> 05:10.620
<b>That's all.</b>

05:11.410 --> 05:12.120
<b>Even if...</b>

05:15.580 --> 05:17.030
<b>Wh-What are you doing?</b>

05:17.030 --> 05:18.510
<b>Sorry.</b>

05:18.510 --> 05:20.540
<b>I mean, it's been bugging me.</b>

05:21.350 --> 05:25.510
<b>I can't understand your "ways,"
but you really are a nice person.</b>

05:27.400 --> 05:30.480
<b>B-Baffling! Let go of me this instant!</b>

05:30.480 --> 05:31.350
<b>Your hand.</b>

05:31.970 --> 05:34.560
<b>It's covered in insect bites
and scratches from branches.</b>

05:34.560 --> 05:39.270
<b>I finally figured out 
how you know about that incident.</b>

05:39.860 --> 05:45.650
<b>You were worried about Ogata then and
were looking for her in the rain, weren't you?</b>

05:50.450 --> 05:54.110
<b>If Ogata and Furuhashi knew
about that, I'm sure they'd...</b>

05:54.110 --> 05:56.210
<b>In fact, why don't I tell them—</b>

05:56.210 --> 05:57.490
<b>Don't you dare.</b>

05:57.490 --> 05:59.250
<b>Meddler. It's none of your business.</b>

05:59.570 --> 06:02.160
<b>That was part of my duties as an instructor.</b>

06:02.160 --> 06:04.400
<b>I didn't do it so anyone would like me.</b>

06:04.400 --> 06:08.090
<b>I couldn't care less whether
the students view me favorably.</b>

06:08.720 --> 06:10.550
<b>Ms. Kirisu...</b>

06:11.350 --> 06:13.420
<b>You're a pain, huh?</b>

06:15.770 --> 06:17.090
<b>What was that?</b>

06:17.090 --> 06:20.860
<b>Yikes! Look, you said you 
don't care what students think!</b>

06:20.860 --> 06:24.690
<b>I could always give 
a full report to the headmaster.</b>

06:24.690 --> 06:27.290
<b>I'm sorry! I got carried away!</b>

06:29.680 --> 06:32.780
<b><i>Sh-She was scariest there at the end.</i></b>

06:35.490 --> 06:37.170
<b>What are you doing?</b>

06:37.170 --> 06:38.460
<b>Sorry, Yuiga!</b>

06:38.460 --> 06:41.520
<b>I might have blurted out
some really embarrassing things!</b>

06:41.520 --> 06:42.530
<b>M-Me too.</b>

06:42.530 --> 06:44.250
<b>Did it work out okay, Yuiga?</b>

06:44.250 --> 06:45.960
<b>Well, more or less.</b>

06:46.590 --> 06:50.570
<b>All right! Let's get psyched up
for more studying today!</b>

06:50.570 --> 06:51.970
<b>Ugh.</b>

06:55.380 --> 06:58.310
<b><i>You really are a nice person.</i></b>

07:01.690 --> 07:03.350
<b><i>No, no, no.</i></b>

07:03.350 --> 07:04.690
<b><i>I can't let my guard down.</i></b>

