07:05.440 --> 07:09.740
HEADMASTER

07:06.220 --> 07:09.740
<b>You seem to be doing well lately, Yuiga.</b>

07:10.100 --> 07:14.950
<b>Even on their last test, they all
improved, with scores near 50%.</b>

07:15.300 --> 07:17.360
<b>That's remarkable progress.</b>

07:17.360 --> 07:20.000
<b>All I can say is keep up the good work.</b>

07:20.000 --> 07:22.810
<b>I will! You can count on me!</b>

07:23.000 --> 07:24.960
<b>grin</b>

07:23.000 --> 07:24.960
<b>grin</b>

07:28.710 --> 07:31.250
<b>What are you smiling about, Yuiga?</b>

07:31.250 --> 07:32.470
<b>It's creepy.</b>

07:33.160 --> 07:34.390
<b>It's been a good day.</b>

07:34.970 --> 07:38.140
<b><i>Their efforts have finally started to pay off.</i></b>

07:38.140 --> 07:39.780
<b><i>Of course I'm going to smile.</i></b>

07:39.780 --> 07:42.020
<b><i>I can't wait until tomorrow's test!</i></b>

07:42.760 --> 07:44.270
<b>Nari, could it be...</b>

07:45.240 --> 07:47.880
<b>that you're going out
with one of those three?</b>

07:49.520 --> 07:51.700
<b>Wh-What are you talking about, Kobayashi?</b>

07:51.700 --> 07:53.180
<b>I'm not dating anyone!</b>

07:53.180 --> 07:56.440
<b>Well, you're always with them.</b>

07:56.440 --> 07:59.620
<b>I figured it wouldn't be weird
if it turned into that.</b>

08:01.260 --> 08:03.270
<b>You're pathetic, Yuiga!</b>

08:03.270 --> 08:06.500
<b>If I were in your shoes,
I'd at least snatch a kiss or two...</b>

08:09.630 --> 08:12.750
<b>Y-Yuiga... D-Don't tell me you...</b>

08:12.750 --> 08:16.890
<b>N-No! It was an accident,
so it's doesn't count!</b>

08:20.220 --> 08:21.820
<b>"Embarrass."</b>

08:21.820 --> 08:23.750
<b>Make someone feel awkward or ashamed.</b>

08:23.750 --> 08:25.170
<b>"Nod."</b>

08:25.170 --> 08:26.190
<b>Bob your head in agreement.</b>

08:26.520 --> 08:30.610
<b>Memory Revision in Progress ...</b>

08:26.520 --> 08:30.610
<b>Memory Revision in Progress ...</b>

08:27.270 --> 08:28.980
<b>You memorized all those words.</b>

08:29.570 --> 08:30.650
<b>I'm proud of you.</b>

08:32.530 --> 08:34.660
<b>Will he praise me if I get a good score?</b>

08:37.960 --> 08:38.990
<b>I can't take it anymore!</b>

08:39.280 --> 08:41.560
<b>What's up, Omoricchi!</b>

08:41.560 --> 08:44.060
<b>Yuiga, you traitor!</b>

08:44.750 --> 08:47.250
<b>I want to kiss a girl, too!</b>

08:52.830 --> 08:56.970
<b>The response to negative questions is opposite 
from the way it is in Japanese,</b>

08:56.970 --> 08:58.460
<b>so you have to be careful.</b>

08:58.460 --> 09:00.600
<b>That said, it's simple.</b>

09:01.140 --> 09:04.870
<b>In English, whether it's a normal
question or negative question,</b>

09:04.870 --> 09:07.570
<b>if you agree, you say, 
"Yes" and "No" if you disagree.</b>

09:07.570 --> 09:08.940
<b>So in this case,</b>

09:08.940 --> 09:11.710
<b>the answer should be, "Yes, I like it."</b>

09:13.440 --> 09:15.650
<b>Hey, Takemoto, are you listening?</b>

09:16.200 --> 09:18.440
<b>Yeah, I'm listening! I'm listening!</b>

09:18.440 --> 09:20.240
<b>Negative questions, right?</b>

09:22.620 --> 09:27.640
<b>Then how would you answer
a question like this?</b>

09:28.700 --> 09:33.010
<b>"Didn't you kiss someone, Nariyuki?"</b>

09:41.500 --> 09:45.310
<b>Takemoto... Where did you hear that?</b>

09:45.310 --> 09:47.060
<b>Listen, that was just...</b>

09:51.450 --> 09:53.900
<b>You're not saying "no," huh?</b>

09:56.610 --> 10:00.820
<b>Awesome! Go for it, Nariyuki!</b>

10:03.740 --> 10:04.750
<b>See you!</b>

10:04.750 --> 10:06.540
<b>I've got to get to my club!</b>

10:06.540 --> 10:07.960
<b>Hey, Takemoto!</b>

10:07.960 --> 10:09.920
<b>You don't have club today, do you?</b>

10:12.930 --> 10:14.960
<b>"Go for it"? Go for what?</b>

10:21.720 --> 10:25.310
<b><i>So Nariyuki has a girlfriend.</i></b>

10:25.820 --> 10:27.460
<b><i>What am I crying for?</i></b>

10:27.460 --> 10:30.590
<b><i>It's my own fault for dragging
my heels since middle school!</i></b>

10:31.520 --> 10:33.110
<b>Huh? Uruka?</b>

10:33.430 --> 10:35.510
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

10:35.510 --> 10:39.080
<b>I thought you were studying
with Yuiga for the test.</b>

10:43.720 --> 10:46.040
<b>Um, let me get this straight.</b>

10:46.040 --> 10:50.140
<b>A friend of yours has liked
this one guy for a long time.</b>

10:50.570 --> 10:55.780
<b>But it seems the guy
already has a girlfriend.</b>

10:55.780 --> 10:57.570
<b>That's what it is?</b>

10:57.570 --> 10:59.040
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

10:59.040 --> 11:02.010
<b>Again, we're talking about a friend of mine!</b>

11:02.810 --> 11:04.310
<b>I get it.</b>

11:04.310 --> 11:07.220
<b>So what's that boy like?</b>

11:08.640 --> 11:13.150
<b>H-He's known my friend
ever since middle school.</b>

11:13.150 --> 11:15.900
<b>He's a handsome boy who
always shows her his notebook,</b>

11:15.900 --> 11:20.280
<b>cheers on her swimming,
and helps her study every day!</b>

11:22.840 --> 11:26.120
<b><i>She's definitely talking about herself and Yuiga!</i></b>

11:26.120 --> 11:30.830
<b>His family is poor, but he's so not self-conscious 
about it and it's actually cool!</b>

11:30.830 --> 11:32.750
<b><i>Okay, that's enough, Uruka!</i></b>

11:33.000 --> 11:38.480
<b><i>So, wait, she likes Yuiga,
and he has a girlfriend?</i></b>

11:38.480 --> 11:41.300
<b><i>I don't know which part surprises me more!</i></b>

11:43.890 --> 11:45.220
<b>Uruka.</b>

11:45.430 --> 11:50.360
<b>Your friend heard that boy kissed someone</b>

11:50.360 --> 11:53.600
<b>and not that he actually
has a girlfriend, right?</b>

11:54.360 --> 11:58.650
<b>In that case, I don't think
your friend needs to give up on him.</b>

11:58.650 --> 12:01.070
<b>Tell your friend this!</b>

12:01.070 --> 12:03.910
<b>That I'm behind her 100%!</b>

12:05.450 --> 12:08.290
<b>F-Fuminocchi! I love you!</b>

12:08.290 --> 12:09.870
<b>H-Hey! Hey!</b>

12:09.870 --> 12:14.130
<b>Fuminocchi!
You're really a true friend!</b>

12:13.580 --> 12:16.830
<b> What are you two doing?</b>

12:15.520 --> 12:16.830
<b>I love you!</b>

12:16.830 --> 12:17.960
<b>Ri...</b>

12:18.880 --> 12:19.800
<b>Oof.</b>

12:20.300 --> 12:22.000
<b>Well, I'm going home.</b>

12:22.000 --> 12:24.430
<b>Thanks for your advice, Fuminocchi!</b>

12:24.430 --> 12:27.340
<b>Hey, did you hear about Yuiga's kiss?</b>

12:27.340 --> 12:30.770
<b>Yeah, Omori was running
through the hall, screaming about it.</b>

12:30.770 --> 12:32.560
<b>I wonder who he kissed.</b>

12:32.560 --> 12:36.250
<b>What, he's had the same girlfriend
for about five years now.</b>

12:36.250 --> 12:37.940
<b>They're living together, right?</b>

12:37.940 --> 12:39.980
<b>I heard they already have a kid.</b>

12:40.900 --> 12:45.160
<b><i>The rumors are having a snowball effect!</i></b>

12:46.540 --> 12:50.930
<b>Uruka, some people just like
to spread w-weird rumors, huh?</b>

12:50.930 --> 12:52.500
<b>What's that?</b>

12:53.080 --> 12:55.870
<b>I-wasn't-listening-at-all!</b>

12:55.870 --> 12:58.670
<b>Well-I'm-going-home-to-study!</b>

12:59.090 --> 13:01.380
<b>Uruka!</b>

13:01.380 --> 13:04.130
<b>I-I hope she's okay.</b>

13:01.890 --> 13:05.260
<b> Study, study, study.</b>

13:07.220 --> 13:08.300
<b>Ri?</b>

13:08.300 --> 13:10.600
<b>Are you all right? Is something wrong?</b>

13:11.000 --> 13:13.600
<b>No, no problem.</b>

13:15.890 --> 13:19.060
<b>R-Really? It's unusual 
for you to drop your things.</b>

13:19.060 --> 13:21.360
<b>I wonder what Yuiga's girlfriend is like.</b>

13:21.360 --> 13:23.940
<b>She's probably a nerd like him.</b>

13:29.220 --> 13:30.490
<b><i>No way.</i></b>

