13:37.580 --> 13:39.860
<b>You worked hard, Furuhashi.</b>

13:39.860 --> 13:42.500
<b>Your score's gone up again.</b>

13:42.500 --> 13:43.880
<b>Thank you.</b>

13:43.880 --> 13:47.050
<b>So why has your score gone down, Takemoto?</b>

13:47.050 --> 13:49.510
<b>You were doing fine until yesterday!
What happened?</b>

13:49.510 --> 13:50.840
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

13:50.840 --> 13:54.730
<b>Somehow I forgot all 
the English words that I learned!</b>

13:54.730 --> 13:55.730
<b>How?</b>

13:56.700 --> 13:58.470
<b><i>So that's what happened?</i></b>

13:58.470 --> 14:02.730
<b><i>Those rumors yesterday
must really have shaken her up.</i></b>

14:02.730 --> 14:04.070
<b>Hi, everyone.</b>

14:09.320 --> 14:10.530
<b>Ogata!</b>

14:10.530 --> 14:12.290
<b>Now why did you do a lousy job?</b>

14:12.290 --> 14:17.160
<b>I'm so sorry! I couldn't concentrate!
I would've been fine if I had stayed focused!</b>

14:17.160 --> 14:18.290
<b>What kind of excuse is that?</b>

14:23.080 --> 14:26.530
<b><i>I can't believe this... I can't believe it.</i></b>

14:26.530 --> 14:32.930
<b><i>Who should I cheer on in this situation?</i></b>

14:32.930 --> 14:37.940
<b>Yuiga, let's talk in 
the Headmaster's room, shall we?</b>

14:40.810 --> 14:43.820
<b>The reason Ri and Uruka's
grades have slipped?</b>

14:43.820 --> 14:45.650
<b>Why are you asking me?</b>

14:45.650 --> 14:50.320
<b>Well, I had the feeling you're sensitive
when it comes to the subtleties of the heart.</b>

14:50.320 --> 14:53.330
<b>For some reason,
it's been awkward talking to them lately.</b>

14:53.330 --> 14:55.490
<b>Did I do something?</b>

14:55.490 --> 14:57.380
<b><i>What a bind.</i></b>

14:57.380 --> 15:00.840
<b><i>"It's because they both like you."</i></b>

15:00.840 --> 15:02.500
<b><i>I can't say that.</i></b>

15:02.500 --> 15:05.250
<b><i>But I want to root for both of them.</i></b>

15:06.510 --> 15:11.670
<b>This must be an exercise in
 the subject of a "woman's heart"!</b>

15:11.670 --> 15:12.990
<b>An "exercise"?</b>

15:12.990 --> 15:14.880
<b>That you have to solve for yourself!</b>

15:14.880 --> 15:16.930
<b>M-Master Furuhashi!</b>

15:19.180 --> 15:20.480
<b>m 617.125 384 l 1188 428.125 1188 565 617.125 538</b>

15:19.180 --> 15:20.480
<b>Girls' Swimming Club</b>

15:20.480 --> 15:24.820
<b>So I still don't know whether
Nariyuki likes someone or not.</b>

15:24.820 --> 15:27.770
<b>There have been a lot of rumors lately.</b>

15:27.770 --> 15:30.430
<b>So that's why your heart 
hasn't been in it lately.</b>

15:30.430 --> 15:32.530
<b>You should just ask him directly.</b>

15:32.530 --> 15:34.050
<b>I could never do that!</b>

15:34.050 --> 15:36.810
<b>I nearly died after just asking
him about that kiss!</b>

15:36.810 --> 15:38.370
<b>Oh, come on, Uruka.</b>

15:38.370 --> 15:41.410
<b>Whether or not Yuiga likes someone...</b>

15:41.410 --> 15:45.040
<b>...all you have to do is
make him crazy about you!</b>

15:45.670 --> 15:48.320
<b>Leave it to us, Uruka!</b>

15:48.800 --> 15:49.940
<b> Bye!</b>

15:49.940 --> 15:50.590
<b> See you tomorrow!</b>

15:50.590 --> 15:51.820
<b> I'll call you later!</b>

15:51.820 --> 15:52.800
<b> Okay!</b>

15:52.800 --> 15:54.050
<b>Listen, Yuiga.</b>

15:54.490 --> 15:57.320
<b>Ri and Uruka are both girls.</b>

15:57.320 --> 16:00.250
<b>Imagine how they feel
and be considerate of them.</b>

16:00.250 --> 16:04.910
<b><i>Imagine and be considerate...
I understand, Furuhashi.</i></b>

16:04.910 --> 16:09.150
<b><i>I think I've unconsciously
been getting too close to them!</i></b>

16:09.650 --> 16:13.420
<b><i>That's right. I mean, they're girls.</i></b>

16:13.420 --> 16:17.660
<b><i>If they like someone,
they sure wouldn't want me getting close.</i></b>

16:18.160 --> 16:21.600
<b><i>I should really back off a bit.</i></b>

16:21.600 --> 16:23.330
<b>N-Nariyuki!</b>

16:31.630 --> 16:32.510
<b>Two
 Buttons 
Undone</b>

16:31.760 --> 16:34.220
<b>W-Want to walk home together?</b>

16:32.800 --> 16:34.220
<b>Skirt 
3 cm 
Shorter</b>

16:34.880 --> 16:39.210
<b><i>I tried doing what they said,
but this is just too embarrassing!</i></b>

16:39.210 --> 16:41.600
<b>Y-Yeah! Let's walk home!</b>

16:42.160 --> 16:45.400
<b><i>Wh-Why am I so nervous?
It's Takemoto!</i></b>

16:45.400 --> 16:48.940
<b><i>But I have to get Nariyuki's heart beating fast!</i></b>

16:48.940 --> 16:50.990
<b><i>I'll move in on him!</i></b>

16:50.990 --> 16:53.450
<b><i>D-Did you forget what you just decided?</i></b>

16:53.450 --> 16:56.870
<b><i>Clear your mind!
And give her more space!</i></b>

17:19.510 --> 17:20.800
<b>What was that?</b>

17:20.800 --> 17:22.220
<b>A strange couple...</b>

17:27.520 --> 17:28.690
<b>Huh?</b>

17:28.690 --> 17:30.170
<b>I'm lost.</b>

