<b><i>Academic success!</i></b>

17:42.870 --> 17:44.620
<b><i>Romantic success!</i></b>

17:53.080 --> 17:54.760
<b><i>Please let me get the VIP recommendation!</i></b>

17:54.760 --> 17:58.080
<b><i>Please let the three of them go
to the college of their choice!</i></b>

17:58.080 --> 18:01.010
<b><i>And let everyone in my family be healthy.</i></b>

18:01.010 --> 18:03.180
<b><i>Wait, that's not academics.</i></b>

18:07.100 --> 18:08.980
<b><i>She's really enthusiastic.</i></b>

18:13.360 --> 18:15.280
<b>Wh-What's this all of a sudden?</b>

18:19.370 --> 18:22.020
<b>Doesn't seem like it's going
to stop anytime soon.</b>

18:22.020 --> 18:24.110
<b>There's been a lot of rain lately.</b>

18:24.110 --> 18:25.890
<b>Well, it's June.</b>

18:25.890 --> 18:27.660
<b>Dumb June...</b>

18:31.540 --> 18:34.970
<b>By the way, you were really 
praying your heart out.</b>

18:34.970 --> 18:37.260
<b>You're getting serious about
the entrance exam.</b>

18:38.880 --> 18:41.090
<b>I forgot about that.</b>

18:41.090 --> 18:42.900
<b>Romantic success...</b>

18:42.900 --> 18:49.100
<b>I was only thinking about getting the heart 
of the boy I like to beat fast for me.</b>

19:04.720 --> 19:06.620
<b>She fell asleep?</b>

19:07.300 --> 19:09.370
<b><i>Uruka is a girl, too.</i></b>

19:13.330 --> 19:14.800
<b><i>Dope, what are you looking at?</i></b>

19:14.800 --> 19:16.410
<b><i>But she's too defenseless!</i></b>

19:16.410 --> 19:18.920
<b><i>And what did she say?</i></b>

19:18.920 --> 19:22.360
<b><i>The boy she likes...
That's what she said.</i></b>

19:22.360 --> 19:25.060
<b><i>Takemoto likes someone? Seriously?</i></b>

19:29.440 --> 19:33.400
<b><i>Umicchi, Kawacchi!
This is how I'm supposed to do it, right?</i></b>

19:33.650 --> 19:38.490
<b><i>It's the "pretend to fall asleep and be
at his mercy when you guys are alone" strategy!</i></b>

19:38.490 --> 19:41.110
<b><i>No boy could resist that!</i></b>

19:42.150 --> 19:44.870
<b><i>I'm so embarrassed
that I can't open my eyes!</i></b>

19:45.400 --> 19:46.870
<b><i>B-But I'll do my best!</i></b>

19:53.020 --> 19:55.730
<b><i>My head feels good.</i></b>

19:59.870 --> 20:01.650
<b><i>H-He just licked me!</i></b>

20:02.710 --> 20:04.840
<b><i>H-Hey, Nariyuki.</i></b>

20:04.840 --> 20:07.890
<b><i>Th-That's going too far!</i></b>

20:14.310 --> 20:17.070
<b>Don't! I'm not mentally prepared
for what happens next!</b>

20:37.420 --> 20:39.670
<b><i>I'm losing confidence in myself.</i></b>

20:39.670 --> 20:42.170
<b><i>Maybe I'm just not attractive.</i></b>

20:51.810 --> 20:53.790
<b>What's wrong, Nariyuki?</b>

20:53.790 --> 20:56.520
<b>There's nothing wrong.</b>

20:56.520 --> 20:58.320
<b>It's just, your chest...</b>

21:10.140 --> 21:12.880
<b>Nariyuki. Your heart is racing.</b>

21:12.880 --> 21:14.920
<b>C-Can you blame me?</b>

21:15.320 --> 21:18.740
<b>When you get close to me
with your top open like that...</b>

21:18.740 --> 21:20.040
<b>Sorry.</b>

21:20.040 --> 21:24.260
<b>I mean... look...</b>

21:25.010 --> 21:29.660
<b>You should only dress like that
in front of the guy you like.</b>

21:30.890 --> 21:32.220
<b>It's dangerous.</b>

21:33.430 --> 21:37.400
<b></b>In front of the guy you like

21:33.770 --> 21:36.670
<b><i>In front of the guy you like...</i></b>

21:39.110 --> 21:41.180
<b>Yeah. I will.</b>

